        {
          "id": "mcp-credential-read-blocked",
          "description": "The headline claim: an off-the-shelf MCP server is asked for a private key, and the request is refused before the server ever sees it. The server has no knowledge of Guardrail and needs none.",
          "critical": true,
          "tags": [],
